  "title": "Cleaning text with stringr",
  "explanation": "These club sign-ups were typed by hand: extra spaces, random capitals, and people who signed up twice. The **stringr** package has functions for fixing text, and they all start with **str_**, so they're easy to find. Then **distinct()** removes duplicate rows.",
